Data source: Wikidata (https://www.wikidata.org). Wikidata's structured data is dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0. The tables are built from the Wikidata JSON dumps at
https://dumps.wikimedia.org/wikidatawiki/entities/. No Wikidata data is included in this
repository other than the synthetic test fixture in tests/fixtures/ (made-up items in the dump
format); the tables are published as a dataset on Hugging Face.

The dump reader (src/arabic_latin_name_variants/stream.py), the age rule and the class-group rule
are adapted from the Bayanat Labs arab-world-wikidata builder (Apache-2.0).

Runtime dependencies: arabic-normalize (Apache-2.0 AND CC-BY-4.0 AND Unicode-3.0), regex
(Apache-2.0 AND CNRI-Python), PyArrow (Apache-2.0), DuckDB (MIT), zstandard (BSD-3-Clause), requests (Apache-2.0).
Optional: orjson (MPL-2.0 AND (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)), Matplotlib (Matplotlib licence, BSD-style).

